Stream-HLS
Copyright Stream-HLS authors
Licensed under the MIT License (licenses/Stream-HLS.txt)
https://github.com/UCLA-VAST/Stream-HLS

ST-Flow generalizes Stream-HLS (FPGA '25): its MLIR dialect, system modeling,
edge conversion and HLS emission passes extend those of Stream-HLS, and the
internal `streamhls` namespace and directory names are inherited from it. The
exception types carry its per-file notice:

  mlir/include/streamhls/Dialect/Dataflow/Bindings/streamhls/exceptions.py

