"SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0" and "SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0"
because its types are shared with the Linux kernel driver. It is used here under
the Apache-2.0 option. No GPL-licensed code is incorporated into ST-Flow.
